# T04 replay script (Marine tutorial: Dropship menu, upgrade, CommTech repair, Synthetic + Sentry Gun, Medic heal).
# Plays the whole tutorial (all 14 goals) by about frame 5920; run 6000 frames. Pad polls, B+n = n polls after the briefing.
# Model: the cursor sits at the screen centre; LS pans the camera (accelerates, d = 0.0113 t^2 up to 38 polls, then 0.88 per poll);
# the cursor ground point is (camera x, camera y - 21.4). Timing is deterministic under replay; goals gate on game time, so keep the gaps.
# close the mission briefing
B+60 start
# skip the intro movie
B+150 a
# g0 "Select the CommTech Marine": A with the cursor (screen centre) over him
B+250 a
# g1 Black opens the Dropship menu
B+330 black
# g2 order two Infantry (A = Select) ...
B+420 a
B+470 a
# ... X confirms the order (menu closes)
B+540 x
# (g3 is time gated: g4 starts 754 frames after X) select the CommTech again
B+1000 a
# g4 Black reopens the menu after the Infantry upgrade got enabled (the menu is built on opening)
B+1340 black
# g5 D-pad right focuses the Upgrade button next to Infantry
B+1410 right
# A opens the confirm menu (focus starts on No)
B+1470 a
# D-pad left focuses Yes
B+1540 left
# A buys the upgrade
B+1600 a
# g6 Black exits the menu
B+1670 black
# g7 select the CommTech
B+1860 a
# LS left 22 polls: camera x -5.4 (cursor = camera x, camera y - 21.4)
B+1900 lleft:22
# LS up 84 polls: camera y -56 (cursor onto the Atmo at 95.2/21.2)
B+1940 lup:84
# B on the damaged Atmo: CommTech walks there and repairs it (g7 area, g8 health 600)
B+2060 b
# camera to the Synthetic at 102/69 while he walks
B+2090 lright:24
B+2140 ldown:73
# g9 select the Synthetic (after the Atmo is repaired, he turns friendly)
B+3360 a
# camera to the Sentry Gun at 106/69
B+3440 lright:19
# g10 B on the Sentry Gun: pick it up
B+3470 b
# camera to the Atmo (97/23)
B+3550 lleft:28
B+3590 lup:72
# B: walk there carrying it
B+3670 b
# camera to the Medic at 108/90 during the walk
B+3710 lright:31
B+3770 ldown:96
# g11 Black drops the Sentry Gun (inside radius 8 of the Atmo)
B+4320 black
# g12 select the Medic
B+4375 a
# camera to the Sniper at 103/88
B+4410 lleft:21
B+4440 lup:13
# g13 B on the Sniper: heal (done about frame 5920)
B+4480 b
